ne at the Big 12 Cross Country Championships" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/10/AD6I5733__2_.JPG" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University cross country team opens its 2026 season Friday, Sept. 11, at the RMU Invitational in Clinton, Pennsylvania.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/10/AD6I5733__2_.JPG" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/10/AD6I5733__2_.JPG"><media:title>Aislinn Frazer crossing the finish line at the Big 12 Cross Country Championships</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/10/AD6I5733__2_.JPG" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 12:05:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59377</s:story_id></item><item><title>Baker Restructures Administrative Duties</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/10/general-baker-restructures-administrative-duties</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/10/general-baker-restructures-administrative-duties</guid><category>General</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="flying wv" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2023/5/8/flying_wv.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – West Virginia University Vice President and Director of Athletics Wren Baker has restructured some administrative leadership duties within the department's senior staff to align and enhance focus on revenue generation, streamline efficiency and better serve WVU's student-athletes, coaches and staff.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&am